h, zu wissen, ob die Stelle in Teilzeit oder stundenweise möglich ist. Ich könnte alle nötigen Dokumente ausdrucken und schriftlich schicken. Vielen Dank im Voraus.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","title":"Eine E-Mail für die Bewerbung","control":"button \"Listen to passage\"","chapter":"a2-22-konjunktiv2-koennte","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":1,"text":"Timo, könntest du mir bei meiner Bewerbung helfen?","speaker":"Ronja","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"A2_022_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-22-konjunktiv2-koennte","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":2,"text":"Klar, könntest du mir zuerst deinen Lebenslauf zeigen?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"A2_022_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-22-konjunktiv2-koennte","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Ja, einen Moment.","speaker":"Ronja","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"A2_022_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-22-konjunktiv2-koennte","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Könnten wir uns morgen treffen?","speaker":"Ronja","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"A2_022_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-22-konjunktiv2-koennte","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":5,"text":"Das könnte klappen, ich schaue in meinen Kalender.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"A2_022_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-22-konjunktiv2-koennte","level":"A2"},{"chapter":"a2-22-konjunktiv2-koennte","level":"A2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Timo, könntest du mir bei meiner Bewerbung helfen?","speaker":"Ronja","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"A2_022_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"a2-22-konjunktiv2-koennte","level":"A2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":2,"text":"Klar, könntest du mir zuerst deinen Lebenslauf zeigen?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"A2_022_L002","reachable":false},{"chapter":"a2-22-konjunktiv2-koennte","level":"A2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":3,"text":"Ja, einen Moment. Könnten wir uns morgen treffen?","speaker":"Ronja","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"A2_022_L003","reachable":false},{"chapter":"a2-22-konjunktiv2-koennte","level":"A2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":4,"text":"Das könnte klappen, ich schaue in meinen Kalender.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"A2_022_L004","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":1,"text":"Könnten Sie mir das Dokument ausdrucken?","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"a2-22-konjunktiv2-koennte","level":"A2"},{"chapter":"a2-22-konjunktiv2-koennte","level":"A2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":1,"text":"Du brauchst dringend ein Dokument. Frag höflich im Büro.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":2,"text":"Wir könnten in die Disco gehen oder zu Hause bleiben.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"a2-22-konjunktiv2-koennte","level":"A2"},{"chapter":"a2-22-konjunktiv2-koennte","level":"A2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":2,"text":"Dein Freund weiß nicht, was er am Abend machen soll.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":3,"text":"Könnte jemand für mich dolmetschen?","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"a2-22-konjunktiv2-koennte","level":"A2"},{"chapter":"a2-22-konjunktiv2-koennte","level":"A2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":3,"text":"Auf dem